# Extra JVM options for the launcher. One per line; lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# If the launcher cannot reach Mojang, Modrinth or anything else while a VPN or proxy
# client is running, that client is probably advertising a SOCKS proxy that does not
# answer. Uncomment the next line to make the launcher connect directly instead.
#-Djava.net.useSystemProxies=false
